    <string name="lock_enable_title">Enable app lock</string>
    <string name="lock_enable_message">Balance will ask for a code, then unlock with your fingerprint on supported devices, before showing your balances. Nothing ever leaves this device.\n\nWhile the app lock is on, the home-screen widget hides your balances and shows a lock instead, and it only works again once the lock is off. This is a choice, not a warning: the widget is built for quick unlocked glances, while the lock protects everything. They cannot both show balances — pick whichever fits you, and switch whenever you like.</string>
